      "message": "As I commented on the other change, I think we could redirect to a different variant of a java_sdk_library (e.g. stub or real impl) depending on whether the two modules are in the same APEX or not.\n\nEven if we don\u0027t do that, I think we only need an option to link with the impl, not the stub because the later is the default. In other words, who will need quuz.stubs when quuz already means the stub variant.",
